                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Conger.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-01-08"><hi rendition="#italic">January 8,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay directs Mr. Conger to insist upon signature of protocol, and approves
                    his action respecting opposition to signing.)</p>
            </div>
